---
import SectionHeading from '../ui/SectionHeading.astro';
import Card from '../ui/Card.astro';
import CTAButton from '../ui/CTAButton.astro';
---

<section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-bg-950">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <SectionHeading align="left">
      Популярные слоты на 1xBet
    </SectionHeading>

    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mt-10">
      <Card class="border-2 border-bg-700" hover={false}>
        <div class="aspect-[16/10] bg-bg-900 border-2 border-brand-500/20 flex items-center justify-center">
          <div class="text-center">
            <svg class="w-12 h-12 mx-auto text-brand-400/40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5" />
            </svg>
            <p class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-600 mt-2 uppercase">GATES OF OLYMPUS</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4">
          <span class="inline-block font-mono text-xs text-brand-400 border border-brand-500/30 px-2 py-0.5 uppercase tracking-wider">Pragmatic Play</span>
          <h3 class="font-mono text-white text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight mt-3 mb-2">Gates of Olympus</h3>
          <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Зевс раздаёт множители до ×500 на каждом спине. Слот без линий — выплаты по кластерам, и на фриспинах множители складываются.</p>
          <div class="flex gap-4 font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider mt-3">
            <span>RTP 96.50%</span>
            <span>Max ×5000</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4">
            <CTAButton href="/gates-of-olympus" variant="outline" size="sm">Крутить Olympus</CTAButton>
          </div>
        </div>
      </Card>

      <Card class="border-2 border-bg-700" hover={false}>
        <div class="aspect-[16/10] bg-bg-900 border-2 border-brand-500/20 flex items-center justify-center">
          <div class="text-center">
            <svg class="w-12 h-12 mx-auto text-brand-400/40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5" />
            </svg>
            <p class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-600 mt-2 uppercase">BOOK OF DEAD</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4">
          <span class="inline-block font-mono text-xs text-brand-400 border border-brand-500/30 px-2 py-0.5 uppercase tracking-wider">Play'n GO</span>
          <h3 class="font-mono text-white text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight mt-3 mb-2">Book of Dead</h3>
          <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Классика с египетской темой и расширяющимися символами. На фриспинах случайный символ заполняет весь барабан — тут залетают крупные выплаты.</p>
          <div class="flex gap-4 font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider mt-3">
            <span>RTP 96.21%</span>
            <span>Max ×5000</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4">
            <CTAButton href="/book-of-dead" variant="outline" size="sm">Открыть Book of Dead</CTAButton>
          </div>
        </div>
      </Card>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
